  "description": "ToolUp.Facts.Presentation Server — the render_chart and render_table AI tools: the model writes a presentation request, the server reads the series it names under the disclosure gate at the tool-result door, draws it with the presentation builders and answers with a text summary the model reads and the block the assistant message carries. And evaluate_pipeline in the same answering form: the summary the model reads and a pipeline block part carrying the request and never a row, with the re-run endpoint a reader's panel draws the block from under the reader's own gate. Composed opt-in with PresentationCompose.withRenderTools and PresentationCompose.withPipelineTool; a deployment that composes neither carries no Fuaran-UI dependency. And the page request resolvers a stored page renders through, a presentation request and a pipeline request answered under the reader's gate and cached per session, composed with PresentationCompose.withPageRequests under a composed fact store.",
